cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it and credit the Emergence Machine project."
title: "Citizen Copilot: a portable civic-assistant specification"
abstract: >-
  A tooling-agnostic specification for a personal civic assistant: permanent
  project instructions plus fifteen single-purpose weekly tasks that watch local
  government, separate fact from opinion, prefer official sources, and trace the
  chain of responsibility from an event to the office and law behind it. Runs
  hosted (cloud project) or self-hosted (local model). Part of the Emergence
  Machine project; sibling to My Citizen Atlas.
type: software
